  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_01",
      "hash64": "C22C7AA9C24788E6",
      "text": "嘿，這位兄弟，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢看起來挺強的嘛。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_02",
      "hash64": "C22C79A9C2478733",
      "text": "嘿，這位小姐，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢看起來挺強的嘛。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_03",
      "hash64": "C22C78A9C2478580",
      "text": "如果是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的話，\\n也許能打倒北上鬼面組喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_select_01",
      "hash64": "F6C6711E164DEA1A",
      "text": "北上鬼面組？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_select_02",
      "hash64": "F6C6701E164DE867",
      "text": "那是些什麼人啊？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_04",
      "hash64": "C22C7FA9C2479165",
      "text": "北上鬼面組會在\\n村子的外面出沒，\\r\\n是一群戴著鬼面具的厲害訓練家。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_05",
      "hash64": "C22C7EA9C2478FB2",
      "text": "那些傢伙最喜歡厲害的孩子，\\n一心想著要跟人一決勝負。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_06",
      "hash64": "C22C7DA9C2478DFF",
      "text": "聽說北上鬼面組\\n一共有７個人……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_07",
      "hash64": "C22C7CA9C2478C4C",
      "text": "要是想跟他們對戰的話要小心，\\n他們可不是什麼好對付的傢伙。\\c\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳每贏過他們之中的一個人，\\n我就給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好東西。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_08",
      "hash64": "C22C83A9C2479831",
      "text": "我聽到風聲了，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳打贏鬼面組了是吧。\\r\\n按照約定，我要給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好東西。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_09",
      "hash64": "C22C82A9C247967E",
      "text": "我聽到風聲了，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳打贏鬼面組了是吧。\\r\\n按照約定，我要給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好東西。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_10",
      "hash64": "C22975A9C2454A90",
      "text": "鬼面組只剩下１個人了……\\n需要提示[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳該去哪裡找人嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_11",
      "hash64": "C22976A9C2454C43",
      "text": "鬼面組還剩[VAR 0x0200(0001)]個人……\\n需要提示[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳該去哪裡找人嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_01",
      "hash64": "36833974D91DF465",
      "text": "自鬼山出，青之方位。\\n身臨竹林，即可見吾。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_02",
      "hash64": "36833674D91DEF4C",
      "text": "極目遠眺，可見鬼角。\\n立足之處，即可見吾。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_03",
      "hash64": "36833774D91DF0FF",
      "text": "滾滾流水，出自鬼口。\\n水邊狹縫，即可見吾。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_04",
      "hash64": "36833474D91DEBE6",
      "text": "可入地獄，亦通樂土。\\n池水之畔，即可見吾。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_05",
      "hash64": "36833574D91DED99",
      "text": "無苦之地，奇岩嶙峋。\\n荒野之中，即可見吾。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_06",
      "hash64": "36833274D91DE880",
      "text": "鬼生雙角，一長一短。\\n登其短者，即可見吾。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_07",
      "hash64": "36833374D91DEA33",
      "text": "不夜之池，水畔之穴。\\n落入穴中，即可見吾。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_12",
      "hash64": "C22977A9C2454DF6",
      "text": "看來……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳已經把鬼面組\\n一個不剩地打倒啦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_13",
      "hash64": "C22978A9C2454FA9",
      "text": "既然[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳如此之強，\\n看來我可以安心拿出真本事了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_14",
      "hash64": "C22979A9C245515C",
      "text": "喝！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_15",
      "hash64": "C2297AA9C245530F",
      "text": "吾人乃是\\n北上鬼面秘組唯一之人……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_16",
      "hash64": "C2297BA9C24554C2",
      "text": "最後的一戰即將開始。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳若是準備好了，\\r\\n儘管前來告知。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_17",
      "hash64": "C2297CA9C2455675",
      "text": "與吾人的最後一戰……\\n是否已準備無礙？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_18",
      "hash64": "C2297DA9C2455828",
      "text": "……那便等[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好了再來。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_30",
      "hash64": "C23001A9C24AA422",
      "text": "讓我們前往合適的地方。\\n……跟吾人來。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_19",
      "hash64": "C2297EA9C24559DB",
      "text": "北上鬼面秘組，村正！\\n請求一戰……接招吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_20",
      "hash64": "C23387A9C24DBDAB",
      "text": "哈哈哈！\\n沒想到[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳連吾人都能戰勝！\\r\\n那份實力值得稱讚！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_21",
      "hash64": "C23386A9C24DBBF8",
      "text": "……………………\\n……………………",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_22",
      "hash64": "C23389A9C24DC111",
      "text": "……開玩笑的！\\n辛苦[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳啦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_23",
      "hash64": "C23388A9C24DBF5E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳剛剛參加的是鬼面組活動！\\n是為了鍛鍊孩子們的腰腿，\\r\\n同時教導他們對戰的樂趣所辦的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_24",
      "hash64": "C2338BA9C24DC477",
      "text": "雖然每逢掩面祭的時期\\n都會辦這活動……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_25",
      "hash64": "C2338AA9C24DC2C4",
      "text": "但工作人員太過認真了，\\n以致於從來沒有孩子能過關！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_26",
      "hash64": "C2338DA9C24DC7DD",
      "text": "能夠連我都打倒的人，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳大概是第一個吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_27",
      "hash64": "C2338CA9C24DC62A",
      "text": "所以說，恭喜[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳了！\\n讓我送獎品給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_28",
      "hash64": "C2337FA9C24DB013",
      "text": "往後[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也要在北上鄉的大自然裡頭\\n把自己培育得更加強大啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
